eer readiness, certification preparation, soft skills development, and employability enhancement through real-world cloud and automation practices aligned with current IT industry standards. Successfully contributed to program execution, student engagement, and institutional collaboration, generating a revenue of approximately ₹1.38 Lakhs through training and academic initiatives.", "activity": "CSR Funded AWS CAD Program (AWS reStart)", "director": "15"}, {"vc": "5", "dean": "5", "score": "5", "nature": "Dicipline Committee", "activity": "Convocation  2026", "director": "3"}, {"vc": "5", "dean": "5", "score": "5", "nature": "Lunch Committee", "activity": "Diksharamb Program 2025", "director": "5"}], "deptActs": [{"vc": "5", "hod": "", "dean": "5", "score": "5", "nature": "Cordinator NAAC 3 Criteria", "activity": "NAAC", "director": "3"}, {"vc": "10", "dean": "10", "score": "10", "nature": "BCA TY Project", "activity": "Project Coordinator", "director": "5"}, {"vc": "5", "dean": "5", "score": "5", "nature": "Btech CSE", "activity": "Project Guide", "director": "3"}], "feedback": [{"vc": "9.1", "fb1": "91.14", "fb2": "91.14", "hod": "", "code": "CSA3102- Cloud Automation and DevOps Sem 6", "dean": "9.1", "score": "9.1", "director": "9", "feedback_1": "91.14", "feedback_2": "91.14", "course_code": "CSA3102- Cloud Automation and DevOps Sem 6"}, {"vc": "9.3", "fb1": "93.05", "fb2": "93.05", "code": "CLC3101- Cloud Infrastructure Orchestration Sem 6", "dean": "9.3", "score": "9.3", "director": "9", "feedback_1": "93.05", "feedback_2": "93.05", "course_code": "CLC3101- Cloud Infrastructure Orchestration Sem 6"}], "industry": [{"vc": "5", "hod": "", "dean": "5", "name": "DevOps Training Delivery at Bitwise Inc.", "score": "5", "details": "Delivered industry-oriented DevOps training sessions at Bitwise Inc. focusing on practical implementation of CI/CD pipelines, Linux administration, Git, Jenkins, Docker, Kubernetes, cloud deployment, automation tools, and DevOps best practices. The training emphasized hands-on learning, real-time industry scenarios, troubleshooting techniques, and workflow automation to enhance participants’ technical competency and industry readiness.", "director": "5"}, {"vc": "5", "dean": "5", "name": "MoU Collaboration with ILEMTEC for AWS re/Start Program", "score": "5", "details": "Facilitated and contributed to the Memorandum of Understanding (MoU) collaboration between the institution and ILEMTEC for the successful implementation of the AWS re/Start Program. The collaboration aimed to strengthen industry-academia engagement by providing students with hands-on training, cloud computing and DevOps skill development, career readiness support, certification awareness, and enhanced employability opportunities aligned with current IT industry requirements.", "director": "3"}], "journals": [{"vc": "9", "hod": "", "dean": "9", "issn": "1005-0930", "index": "Scopus", "score": "30", "title": "Health Monitoring System Integrating IoT and Machine Learning for Cardiac Prognosis", "journal": "Journal of Basic Science and Engineering", "director": "15", "indexing": "Scopus"}, {"vc": "9", "dean": "9", "issn": "OI: 10.1109/INCSST64791.2025.11210339", "index": "Scopus", "score": "30", "title": "Crop Recommendation Using Comparative Machine Learning Techniques with a Tuned CatBoost Classifier", "journal": "International Conference on Smart & Sustainable Technology", "director": "30", "indexing": "Scopus"}, {"vc": "5", "dean": "5", "issn": "979-8-3503-9177-0", "index": "Scopus", "score": "30", "title": "IoT-Enabled Heart Disease Prediction: Harnessing Machine Learning for Proactive Healthcare", "journal": "International Conference on Computing, Communication, Control and Automation (ICCUBEA)", "director": "30", "indexing": "Scopus"}], "lectures": [{"vc": "0", "hod": "", "sem": "V", "code": "CSA3004 Cloud Native Orchestration", "dean": "0", "score": "10", "planned": "40", "director": "10", "semester": "V", "conducted": "38", "co