utational skills, and student engagement through technology-enabled education"}, {"vc": "5", "hod": "5", "dean": "5", "desc": "A Next-Generation ICT-Enabled Digital Learning Ecosystem was developed for Chemical Engineering students through a dedicated Google Site integrating self-created videos, subject resources, career guidance, and digital learning tools. The platform provides a centralized, interactive, and 24×7 accessible learning environment that supports blended learning, self-paced education, and enhanced student engagement.", "quad": "High Innovation and High Technology Integration", "type": "Development of Innovative pedagogy which does not exists globally", "score": "5", "title": "Design and Development of an Innovative Faculty-Driven Digital Learning Ecosystem for Chemical Engineering Students", "director": "5", "quadrant": "High Innovation and High Technology Integration", "description": "A Next-Generation ICT-Enabled Digital Learning Ecosystem was developed for Chemical Engineering students through a dedicated Google Site integrating self-created videos, subject resources, career guidance, and digital learning tools. The platform provides a centralized, interactive, and 24×7 accessible learning environment that supports blended learning, self-paced education, and enhanced student engagement."}], "fdps": [{"vc": "5", "hod": "5", "org": "AICTE-Madanapalle Institute of Technology & Science", "dean": "5", "score": "10", "program": "Aicte Training And Learning (Atal) Academy Faculty Development Program on Smart And Sustainable Waste Management Using Iot And Data Analytics At Madanapalle Institute of Technology & Science", "director": "5", "duration": "15/09/2025 to 20/09/2025", "organization": "AICTE-Madanapalle Institute of Technology & Science"}, {"vc": "5", "hod": "5", "org": "Nelson Mandela Marg, Vasant Kunj, New Delhi", "dean": "5", "score": "10", "program": "Emerging Frontiers in Energy, Climate and Sustainability", "director": "5", "duration": "08/09