": "", "director": "", "duration": ""}], "innovRows": [{"vc": "2", "dean": "2", "score": "2", "method": "Quizes", "details": "Designed and conducted multiple interactive quizzes in the Cyber Security subject to enhance student engagement and participation during lectures. Most of the quizzes were case study and scenario-based, enabling students to develop practical problem-solving skills and apply theoretical concepts to real-world cybersecurity situations.", "director": "2"}, {"vc": "2", "dean": "2", "score": "2", "method": "Coursera course", "details": "Integrated Coursera-based assignments into the teaching-learning process to encourage self-paced learning and industry-oriented skill development among students. Students were assigned relevant online courses and assessments to enhance their conceptual understanding and exposure to emerging technologies.", "director": "2"}, {"vc": "2", "dean": "2", "score": "2", "method": "LMS module for academic activities", "details": "The Learning Management System (LMS) module was effectively utilized as a communication and academic support platform for students throughout the academic session. The LMS served as a centralized medium for conducting and managing various teaching-learning activities in an organized and efficient manner.", "director": "2"}, {"vc": "2", "dean": "2", "score": "2", "method": "Blended mode of teaching", "details": "Considering the academic requirements and professional commitments of working professionals, lectures and revision sessions were conducted in both online and offline modes to ensure flexibility and effective learning support.", "director": "2"}, {"vc": "2", "dean": "2", "score": "2", "method": "self paced learning", "details": "To promote flexible and continuous learning, I create and share recorded video lectures on Cyber Security topics. These videos provide concise coverage of key concepts and are made available to students for self-paced learning. The recordings enable students to revisi