 of Constitution Day celebrations at DYPIU, promoting constitutional values and civic awareness among students.", "level": "National", "score": 6, "title": "Constitution Day Celebration", "director": "1", "organization": "DYPIU"}], "quals": [{"vc": "", "label": "", "score": ""}], "awards": [{"vc": "", "date": "", "level": "", "score": "", "title": "", "agency": "", "award_date": ""}], "society": [{"vc": "5", "dean": "5", "label": "Unnat Bharat Abhiyan", "score": "5", "details": "As part of DYPIU’s social outreach initiatives commemorating the birthday of Hon’ble Dr. D. Y. Patil Sir, I actively contributed to community engagement activities in the adopted village of Sathesai, Taluka Mulshi, Pune District. Representing the School of Mass Media & Journalism, I coordinated the donation of dustbins to promote cleanliness, environmental awareness, and sustainable community practices. The initiative involved village-level outreach, stakeholder coordination, and sensitizing students towards social responsibility, sanitation awareness, and community development. Through this contribution, I supported DYPIU’s vision of rural engagement and education-driven social transformation.", "activity": "Unnat Bharat Abhiyan", "director": "4"}, {"vc": "5", "_id": 1780038530292.663, "dean": "5", "label": "Social outreach and wellness initiatives including Yoga Sessions and Blood Donation", "score": "5", "details": "Actively participated in and supported university-led social outreach and wellness initiatives including Yoga Sessions and Blood Donation Drives organized at DYPIU. Contributed towards promoting health awareness, community service, social responsibility, and student participation through coordination, student mobilization, and institutional engagement activities aligned with the university’s commitment to holistic development and social well-being.", "activity": "Social outreach and wellness initiatives including Yoga Sessions and Blood Donation", "director": "4"}], "uniActs": [{"vc": "5", "dean": "5", "score": 5, "nature": "Played a major leadership and coordination role in organizing “Indus Fiesta 2026,” the annual cultural and academic festival of DYPIU involving large-scale student participation, cultural performances, competitions, and academic activities.", "activity": "Indus Fiesta 2026 : Dates: 22 January – 25 January 2026", "director": "5"}, {"vc": "5", "_id": 1779883390110.742, "dean": "5", "score": 5, "nature": "Actively involved in planning, stage coordination, protocol management, communication, and smooth execution of the 5th Convocation Ceremony of DYPIU.", "activity": "5th Convocation Ceremony : Date: 05 February 2026", "director": "5"}, {"vc": "5", "_id": 1779883497419.2068, "dean": "5", "score": 5, "nature": "Contributed to organizing and coordinating the 8th Foundation Day celebrations of DYPIU, reflecting institutional growth and achievements.", "activity": "Foundation Day Celebration : Date: 14 March 2026", "director": "5"}, {"vc": "5", "_id": 1779883650757.0127, "dean": "5", "score": 5, "nature": "Coordinated and supported the organization of “Samarth Talks,” hosted by DYPIU in partnership with Hyundai and Times Network, focusing on inclusivity and accessibility awareness.", "activity": "Samarth Talks – Inclusivity Initiative : Date: 23 November 2025", "director": "5"}, {"vc": "5", "_id": 1779883783667.1487, "dean": "5", "score": 5, "nature": "A significant contribution during the academic year was the systematic and structured strengthening of the Student Council framework at DYPIU.  As Director – Student Welfare, I played an instrumental role in initiating, organizing, mentoring, and streamlining student leadership participation through a more structured Student Council mechanism for the first time at the university level. The initiative contributed significantly towards building a more participative, inclusive, and student-centric academic environment at DYPIU.", "activity": "Structured Formation and Strengthening of Student Council", "director": "5"}, {"vc": "5", "_id": 1779883929536.2542, "dean": "5", "score": 1, "nature": "Actively participated in planning and execution of Alumni Meet 2025, strengthening alumni engagement and institutional networking.", "activity": "Alumni Meet 2025 : Date: 22 November 2025", "director": "1"}, {"vc": "20", "_id": 1779884121300.7727, "dean": "20", "score": 1, "nature": "Led the Flying Squad Team during end-term examinations, ensuring discipline, transparency, and smooth conduct of examination-related activities.", "activity": "Examination Flying Squad Leadership : Dates: 07 May – 15 May 2026", "director": "1"}, {"vc": "10", "_id": 1779884163851.8975, "dean": "10", "score": 1, "nature": "Represented DYPIU as a speaker at the Times Education Expo 2026, delivering an expert talk and enhancing institutional outreach and visibility.", "activity": "Representation at Times Education Expo 2026: Date: 17 May 2026", "director": "1"}, {"vc": "5", "_id": 1780042143658.1729, "dean": "5", "score": 2, "nature": "Actively contributed to the planning, coordination, promotion, and execution of the cultural event “Viksit Bharat Ke Rang, Kala Ke Sang,” which provided a creative platform for DYPIU students to express their vision of a developed India through various forms of art, culture, and creative expression. The event encouraged student participation, artistic innovation, national consciousness, and interdisciplinary engagement aligned with the vision of “Viksit Bharat.”", "activity": "Viksit Bharat Ke Rang, Kala Ke Sang", "director": "2"}], "deptActs": [{"vc": "5", "dean": "5", "score": 7, "nature": "Actively facilitated and coordinated the Film Appreciation Course conducted in collaboration with Film and Television Institute of India (FTII), Pune, enabling students to gain exposure to cinematic studies and media learning through institutional collaboration.", "activity": "Collaboration Initiative with FTII Pune", "director": "2"}, {"vc": "5", "_id": 1779883142510.4875, "dean": "5", "score": 7, "nature": "As HoD of the School of Media and Communication Studies, I consistently encouraged and facilitated guest lectures, expert sessions, industry–academia interactions, educational visits, social outreach activities, and industrial tours to provide students with practical exposure and experiential learning opportunities. I also actively contributed towards strengthening the academic and institutional visibility of the School by developing bilingual e-content (Hindi and English) to ensure that the benchmarks, achievements, and innovative initiatives of the School reached a wider student community and promoted inclusive learning.", "activity": "Guest lectures, expert sessions etc.", "director": "0"}, {"vc": "10", "_id": 1780039243137.5225, "dean": "10", "score": 6, "nature": "Actively contributed towards institutional documentation, data compilation, content development, and coordination work related to NAAC quality assurance processes. Played a significant role in preparing and organizing documents for University Criteria–5 and School-Level Criteria–1 for the School of Media and Communication Studies, ensuring systematic presentation of academic, student support, curricular, and institutional quality initiatives in alignment with accreditation and assessment requirements.", "activity": "Documentation work related to NAAC", "director": "6"}], "feedback": [{"vc": "7", "fb1": "70", "fb2": "70", "code": "JMC 3602 - Environmental Studies and Journalism", "dean": "7", "score": "7.0", "director": "7", "feedback_1": "70", "feedback_2": "70", "course_code": "JMC 3602 - Environmental Studies and Journalism"}, {"vc": "5", "_id": 1780034976486.0461, "fb1": "50", "fb2": "50", "code": "JMC 1216 - Indian Knowledge System & Communciation", "dean": "5", "score": "5.0", "director": "5", "feedback_1": "50", "feedback_2": "50", "course_code": "JMC 1216 - Indian Knowledge System & Communciation"}], "journals": [{"vc": "", "issn": "", "inde