ual understanding and long-term retention.", "director": "2"}, {"score": "2", "method": "Compulsory Hands-on Execution Model", "details": "Ensured mandatory student participation in practical implementation activities such as cloud deployment, Linux administration, CI/CD pipeline creation, Docker containerization, and infrastructure automation to promote experiential learning.", "director": "1"}], "projects2": [{"hod": "", "date": "", "role": "", "score": "", "title": "", "agency": "", "amount": "", "status": "", "director": "", "sanction_date": "", "project_status": ""}], "proposals": [{"hod": "", "score": "", "title": "", "agency": "", "amount": "", "director": "", "duration": ""}], "courseFile": [{"hod": "", "score": "10", "title": "BTech (CSE) CC Track - SEM V", "course": "CLC3001 Fundamental of Cloud Computing", "details": "1.Available", "director": "10"}, {"hod": "", "score": "", "title": "BTech (CSE) CC Track - SEM VO", "course": "CSA3004 Cloud Native Orchestration", "details": "1.Available", "director": ""}, {"hod": "", "score": "", "title": "BCA TY - SEM VI", "course": "CSA3102 Cloud Automation and Devops", "details": "1.Available", "director": ""}, {"hod": "", "score": "", "title": "BCA TY - SEM V", "course": "CLC3101 Cloud Infrastructure Orchestration", "details": "1.Available", "director": ""}], "externalProjects": [{"hod": "", "date": "", "role": "", "score": "", "title": "", "agency": "", "amount": "", "status": "", "director": "", "sanction_date": "", "project_status": ""}], "innovativeTeaching": {"director": "8"}}	Reviewed	2026-06-06 18:15:45.363894+05:30	2026-06-06 18:15:45.363899+05:30	2026-08-25 23:49:25.410983+05:30	0	0	\N
