ages, slider-crank mechanisms, Geneva mechanisms, cams and followers, and compliant mechanisms were designed and fabricated using additive manufacturing techniques."}, {"hod": "5", "desc": "Moocs Platform for Robotics", "quad": "II", "type": "Google Classroom, Virtual Labs, MOOCs, YouTube E-content, LMS-Based Learning Modules", "score": "5", "title": "Moocs Platform", "quadrant": "II", "description": "Moocs Platform for Robotics"}, {"hod": "5", "desc": "Moocs Platform for Engineering Graphics", "quad": "II", "type": "Google Classroom, Virtual Labs, MOOCs, YouTube E-content, LMS-Based Learning Modules", "score": "5", "title": "Moocs Platform", "quadrant": "II", "description": "Moocs Platform for Engineering Graphics"}, {"hod": "5", "desc": "nline educational content was created through the “Mechanical Zone 2026” YouTube channel, where conceptual videos related to mechanical engineering subjects were uploaded for student learning and revision", "quad": "I", "type": "Video lecture", "score": "5", "title": "E Content- Mechanical zone 2026 Youtube Channel", "quadrant": "I", "description": "nline educational content was created through the “Mechanical Zone 2026” YouTube channel, where conceptual videos related to mechanical engineering subjects were uploaded for student learning and revision"}, {"hod": "5", "desc": "Robotics and Automation", "quad": "I", "type": "Video lecture", "score": "5", "title": "Course Builder", "quadrant": "I", "description": "Robotics and Automation"}, {"hod": "5", "desc": "Pedagogy used in Chasis Fixtures welding", "quad": "III", "type": "3D Printed Components used in EBAJA Vehicle fixtures", "score": "5", "title": "Pedagogy Initiative in Chasis Fixure", "quadrant": "III", "description": "Pedagogy used in Chasis Fixtures welding"}], "fdps": [{"hod": "5", "org": "MITWPU", "score": "5", "program": "Robotic vision using ROS and Machine learning 3 October to 15 October 2025", "director": "", "duration": "2 Week", "organization": "MITWPU"}, {"hod": "