29789185/)  For the first time in the history of DYPIU, a dedicated university anthem was conceptualized, created, and professionally recorded as a symbol of institutional pride, unity, vision, and cultural identity.  I played a key leadership and creative role in this landmark initiative by contributing as:  Lyricist of the DYPIU Anthem Lead Vocalist/Singer Conceptual Coordinator for Anthem Development  The anthem was musically arranged by Shri Sreyas Deshpande and recorded at the iconic Dawn Studio, Pune — a legendary studio historically associated with Bharat Ratna Lata Mangeshkar.  This initiative stands as a historic contribution towards the cultural and emotional identity of DYPIU.", "details": "Creation of the Historic DYPIU Anthem", "director": ""}], "projects": [{"label": "Project guided: Guided student projects in Television Journalism", "score": "3", "director": "2"}, {"_id": 1780034050242.701, "label": "Project guided: Guided student projects in Environmental Journalism", "score": "3", "director": "2"}, {"_id": 1780034310297.5957, "label": "Project guided: Guided student projects in Indian Knowledge System and Communication", "score": "4", "director": "1"}], "research": [{"name": "", "score": "", "degree": "", "thesis": "", "director": "", "student_name": ""}], "training": [{"score": "", "nature": "", "company": "", "director": "", "duration": ""}], "innovRows": [{"score": "2", "method": "1.\\tBlended learning", "details": "Combination of classroom teaching with digital resources.", "director": "1"}, {"score": "2", "method": "2.\\tVirtual Lab", "details": "Use of newspapers and digital media tools in Television Journalism and Corporate Communication.", "director": "2"}, {"score": "2", "method": "3.\\tConceptual videos (list of video shared to students, and class photo of activity)", "details": "Shared conceptual videos related to folk culture, communication campaigns, documentaries, and television reporting.", "director": "1"}, {"score": "2", "method": "