dmark initiative by contributing as:  Lyricist of the DYPIU Anthem Lead Vocalist/Singer Conceptual Coordinator for Anthem Development  The anthem was musically arranged by Shri Sreyas Deshpande and recorded at the iconic Dawn Studio, Pune — a legendary studio historically associated with Bharat Ratna Lata Mangeshkar.  This initiative stands as a historic contribution towards the cultural and emotional identity of DYPIU.", "score": 20, "usage": "(Link of the Anthem: https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7425640402029789185/)  For the first time in the history of DYPIU, a dedicated university anthem was conceptualized, created, and professionally recorded as a symbol of institutional pride, unity, vision, and cultural identity.  I played a key leadership and creative role in this landmark initiative by contributing as:  Lyricist of the DYPIU Anthem Lead Vocalist/Singer Conceptual Coordinator for Anthem Development  The anthem was musically arranged by Shri Sreyas Deshpande and recorded at the iconic Dawn Studio, Pune — a legendary studio historically associated with Bharat Ratna Lata Mangeshkar.  This initiative stands as a historic contribution towards the cultural and emotional identity of DYPIU.", "details": "Creation of the Historic DYPIU Anthem"}], "projects": [{"dean": "2", "label": "Project guided: Guided student projects in Television Journalism", "score": "3", "director": "2"}, {"_id": 1780034050242.701, "dean": "2", "label": "Project guided: Guided student projects in Environmental Journalism", "score": "3", "director": "2"}, {"_id": 1780034310297.5957, "dean": "2", "label": "Project guided: Guided student projects in Indian Knowledge System and Communication", "score": "4", "director": "1"}], "research": [{"dean": "", "name": "", "score": "", "degree": "", "thesis": "", "student_name": ""}], "training": [{"dean": "", "score": "", "nature": "", "company": "", "duration": ""}], "innovRows": [{"dean": "1", "score": "2", "method": "1.\\tBlended l