 of Wire Bonding Parameters for Enhanced Reliability Using Low-Cost Desktop Bonders", "agency": "DYPIU", "amount": "990000", "director": "", "duration": "2 Year"}], "courseFile": [{"hod": "", "score": "20", "title": "SEM II", "course": "ESC2105T- Analog IC Design", "details": "1.Available", "director": ""}, {"hod": "", "score": "20", "title": "SEM I", "course": "ESC1003T Basic Electronics Engineering", "details": "1.Available", "director": ""}], "innovScore": "10", "innovDetails": "Website, Quiz, Blended learning Courseera, Project Based Learning Presentation, Project Based Learning, Guest Lecture-AID", "externalProjects": [{"hod": "", "role": "", "score": "", "title": "", "agency": "", "amount": "", "sanction_date": "", "project_status": ""}], "internalProjects": [], "summaryOtherInfo": "During the academic year, I actively participated as a member of the organizing committee for various IEEE events. I also worked as a Teacher Guardian, mentoring and supporting students in their academic and professional development. As a member of the organizing committee of the IEEE Student Branch at DYPIU, Akurdi, I contributed to the successful organization of the one-day event titled “From Student to Silicon Pro” on 8th November 2025, which aimed to bridge the gap between academia and the semiconductor industry. Additionally, I actively contributed to the planning, coordination, and execution of the Semiconductor Technology Leadership Summit 2026. I also served as a Coordinator in the IET Accreditation Process, supporting documentation work, coordination activities, and academic quality initiatives. Further, I worked as a team member in organizing National Science Day activities conducted on 28th February 2026. To strengthen industry interaction and institutional development, I initiated and participated in discussions for industrial collaboration with Mr. Bhairav Shah, Founder and CTO of Parshwanath Robotics, Pune. I also participated in discussions and coordination activities for establishing academic collaboration with COEP.", "sectionSaveStatus": {"partA": true, "partB": true}, "sectionApplicability": {"society": "applicable", "projects": "notApplicable", "research": "notApplicable"}}, "status": "Pending HOD Review", "totals": {"grandTotal": 343.1307857142857, "partATotal": 163.6307857142857, "partBTotal": 179.5, "effectiveGrandMax": 510, "effectivePartAMax": 165, "effectivePartBMax": 345}, "review_chain": ["hod", "director", "dean", "vc"], "academic_year": "2025-2026", "next_reviewer": "hod", "workflow_status": "Pending HOD Review", "submitter_profile": {"email": "sandhya.shinde@dypiu.ac.in", "school": "SoEMR", "full_name": "Dr Sandhya Shinde", "department": "Semiconductor Engineering", "experience": "14", "designation": "Assistant Professor", "employee_id": "20241030", "qualification": "PhD.", "appraisal_role": "faculty", "reportsToRegistrar": false, "teaching_experience": "14", "reports_to_registrar": false}, "next_reviewer_role": "hod"}	2026-05-19 15:20:48.829626+05:30	2026-08-25 23:49:25.410983+05:30
