 teaching commenced after completion of the Student Induction Programme, resulting in a shorter effective teaching period than the standard academic schedule.\\n\\n(7) JUNO ERP/LMS records may occasionally reflect lecture count discrepancies due to timetable mapping, data synchronization, or reporting issues; lesson plans, attendance records, and teaching documents may be referred to for verification.\\n\\n(8) Contribution to university-level academic, admission, examination, accreditation, outreach, documentation, and student-support activities beyond regular teaching and research responsibilities.\\n\\n(9) Achievements in university sports activities including Table Tennis (Singles), Table Tennis (Doubles), and Chess competitions.\\n", "sectionSaveStatus": {"partA": true, "partB": true}, "sectionApplicability": {"society": "notApplicable", "projects": "applicable", "research": "notApplicable"}}, "status": "Pending Center Head Review", "totals": {"grandTotal": 236.261375, "partATotal": 146.261375, "partBTotal": 90, "effectiveGrandMax": 510, "effectivePartAMax": 165, "effectivePartBMax": 345}, "review_chain": ["center_head", "vc"], "academic_year": "2025-2026", "next_reviewer": "center_head", "workflow_status": "Pending Center Head Review", "submitter_profile": {"email": "rishikant.rajdeepak@dypiu.ac.in", "school": "CISR", "full_name": "Dr Rishikant Rajdeepak", "department": "", "experience": "4", "designation": "Assistant Professor", "employee_id": "20221009", "qualification": "Ph.D.", "appraisal_role": "faculty", "reportsToRegistrar": false, "teaching_experience": "4", "reports_to_registrar": false}, "next_reviewer_role": "center_head"}	2026-05-27 21:49:20.67231+05:30	2026-08-25 23:49:25.410983+05:30
