ntura - A non-invasive respiratory apparatus", "agency": "ANRF", "amount": "30000000", "director": "", "duration": "3 years"}, {"score": "10", "title": "GAMBIT:Gaming Addiction and Mental health burden invention using technology", "agency": "ANRF", "amount": "50000000", "duration": "5 years"}], "courseFile": [{"hod": "", "score": "20", "title": "BTech Bioengineering Sem III", "course": "EDF2005 Design Thinking and Fabrication", "details": "1.Available", "director": ""}, {"hod": "", "score": "20", "title": "MSc Medical  Biotechnology Sem I", "course": "MAT4005 Biomaterials - Nano and Micro materials", "details": "1.Available", "director": ""}, {"hod": "", "score": "20", "title": "MSc Medical Biotechnology Sem III", "course": "BMD5004 Biomedical Devices", "details": "1.Available", "director": ""}, {"hod": "", "score": "20", "title": "BTech Bioengineering Sem IV", "course": "GEN2101 Genetics", "details": "1.Available", "director": ""}, {"hod": "", "score": "20", "title": "BTech Bioengineering Sem VI", "course": "MAT3105 Biomaterials", "details": "1.Available", "director": ""}], "innovScore": "10", "innovDetails": "Quiz, Use of learning management system, Group Discussion and Debate, Public availability of resources, Research Article analysis", "externalProjects": [{"hod": "", "role": "", "score": "", "title": "", "agency": "", "amount": "", "sanction_date": "", "project_status": ""}], "internalProjects": [], "summaryOtherInfo": "As the Head of the Department of Bioengineering, I have taken care of the admission, results, examinations, day-to-day activities of the School. Under the directions of the School Director, I have spearheaded the teaching load calculation of the faculty of the School and have aided in drafting of the Academic Regulations. With help from School faculty, I have also led the restructuring of the curriculum and course structure of B.Tech. Bioengineering. \\nI have also ensured smooth communication as the ACU ambassador on every day scale and hosted